window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"nasus","b":"masteryi","win":["Nasus","Skill","Master Yi","Master Yi","Master Yi","Master Yi","Nasus"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 1","text":"Sustain and bulk win the opening trade"},{"when":"Wither maxed + tank core","text":"Outside Highlander he cannot outrun you"},{"when":"2+ items","text":"Stacked Q deletes him once Highlander is down"}],"wants":{"you":["Safe stacks through his pressure window","Wither once Highlander expires","Reaching full tank with big stacks"],"foe":["True-damage trades from level 3 on","Highlander to shrug off your Wither","First-item roams while you are pinned"]},"early":"Take the level-1 trade if he is rude — your sustain wins it — but recognise that the window slams shut at 2 when Meditate and his true damage arrive. From 3 onward stop trading entirely: Wuju cuts straight through armour, and every extended exchange leaks health you will want later. Stack what is safe.","mid":"Levels 4-6 are his: one Wither does not stop the all-in and Highlander shrugs the slow off outright, so farm under tower, ward the dive and never die for a stack. Meditate heals through your chip and you have no CC to break the channel — bring Grievous Wounds. His first item sends him roaming; ping and keep stacking.","late":"Fully stacked with tank items, the duel flips completely: Wither alone reduces him to a jogging target and Siphoning Strike chunks a third of his bar per swing. But Highlander makes him immune to slows — Wither him before he ults, or wait it out. Take every sidelane duel once it drops.","whys":["Your level-1 lifesteal and bulk make his early trade a losing one — a squishy Yi cannot chew through your sustain yet.","At 2 his core spells arrive — true damage and Meditate start matching your Siphoning Strike trades, pulling the level even.","From 3 his Wuju true damage ignores your armour and wins extended trades cleanly — stop taking them.","Around 4-5 his all-in goes straight through a single Wither — one slow no longer stops the dive.","At 6 Highlander makes him immune to slows, so Wither stops working for its whole duration — respect that window.","His first item lets him shove and roam while you are stuck stacking under tower — the map tilts his way.","Fully stacked and full tank, you out-scale him — Wither cripples his whole kit and your Q deletes him, so the late game is yours."]});
